EC users:
On PPP, can obtain a node with X for an interactive session:
qsub -I -X -lselect=1:ncpus=80:mpiprocs=80:ompthreads=1:mem=100gb -lplace=scatter

Interactive only, commands (examples) as follows:

scmcase -h
scmcase -list # list cases
scmcase -get gabls-3 # obtain case to put in current directory
runscm > mylist 2>&1 # run to create results
tsplot --var=TJ results/gabls-3 # plot a result
scmdiag -h # create more variable diagnostics using plugins
scmdiag --list # lists the plugins avail
scmdiag --var=WSPD,WDIR results/gabls-3 # adds WSPD,WDIR to series
profplot --var=2T --time=1h30m results/* # profile plot
profplot --var=WSPD --time=1h30m results/*
scmdiag --var=THETA results/gabls-3
profplot --var=THETA --time=1h30m results/*
tephiplot -t 6h:12h results/gabls-3 # tephi plot

prepscm # to create new set of data for runscm - see wiki SCM
